  "title": "Gitlab CI: Use the Medium GitLab SaaS Linux Runner for Clang-Tidy",
  "description": "Using clang-tidy and doing recursion checks has made the\nClang + Code Checks job take a long time, especially on\nchanges where the compiler cache isn't helping much. Sometimes\nit's timing out, and it's generally twice as long as the other\njobs or more.\n\nGitLab allows the saas-linux-medium-amd64 runners for all tiers,\nlet's use that for this job.\nhttps://about.gitlab.com/blog/2023/08/01/medium-gitlab-saas-runners-on-linux-now-available-to-all-tiers/",
